    "tag_name": "v1.0.2",
    "name": "Portable Flashing Package: Rondo 1.0.2",
    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=jarvissax%2Frondo&amp;tag=v1.0.2#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Y1 \u00b7 Type A**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/releases/download/v1.0.2/rom-windows.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/releases/download/v1.0.2/rom-linux.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/releases/download/v1.0.2/rom-macos.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\nRondo 1.0.2 is about the server: it now updates itself with one click from its admin page. **Nothing changes on the Y1 itself**; it still offers this version as an update so the Y1 and the server stay on the same number.\n\n## What's new\n\n- **Update the server with one click.** When a newer Rondo is out, the server's admin page offers **Update**: the server downloads the new version and restarts on it in a minute or two, keeping your settings, YouTube account and connected Y1. A small companion container, `rondo-updater`, does the work; it only ever touches the Rondo server's own container, and if the new version doesn't start, the old one comes back by itself.\n- **Ready-made server images.** Installing the server now downloads it instead of building it on your machine, for regular PCs and 64-bit ARM (Raspberry Pi 4 and 5, many NAS boxes). The first start is much quicker on small machines.\n\nThe full list is in [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/jarvissax/rondo/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md).\n\n## Moving your server over\n\nA server set up before 1.0.2 built itself and has no updater yet. Update it by hand once, and **Update** on the admin page does it from then on:\n\n```bash\ncd rondo\ngit pull\ndocker compose -f infra/compose.home.yaml pull      # or compose.vps.yaml\ndocker compose -f infra/compose.home.yaml up -d\n```\n\nYour admin password, YouTube account and connected Y1 stay. Details: [Keeping it running](https://github.com/jarvissax/rondo/blob/main/docs/server.md#keeping-it-running).\n\n## The Y1\n\nIf your Y1 runs Rondo 1.0.1, **Settings \u203a Software update**, **Install** in the dashboard or [the update page](https://jarvissax.github.io/rondo/) bring it to 1.0.2 in a minute; nothing else changes. New to Rondo: choose **Rondo** in [Innioasis Updater CE](https://innioasis.app) (Y1, then Type A), or install `rom.zip` below with the Updater's **Settings \u203a Install from a file\u2026**. Only for the **Y1 Type A**.\n\n## Files\n\n- `rom.zip`: the firmware, for Innioasis Updater CE (Y1 Type A), built from `rondo-1.0.2.apk` by the release workflow.\n- `rondo-1.0.2.apk`: the update, for a Y1 that already runs the Rondo firmware.\n- `updater.png`: the picture Innioasis Updater CE shows for this release.\n- The server images: `ghcr.io/jarvissax/rondo-server:1.0.2` and `ghcr.io/jarvissax/rondo-updater:1.0.2` (also `latest`).\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"99b8a0b58bddccb2475ebf3abb5c9e3c11fa9ccd14a80d14635ba6dcb8156017\",\"size\":844849919,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"65882c6b65a9e1745880deafc941141b8a28fad135cca702910d087b894e5ada\",\"size\":578892932,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"1a4f35982d4578f51083c39aafbbed0cc4c8f4c3041ba51cc5c64fd725fe9542\",\"size\":663360937,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-08T00:59:21Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"2e9ea4f87a8876038e9cfd8ed1f13a6da8038e72cc1d9f80141dc34c917bbec4\",\"original_assets\":[\"rom.zip\",\"rondo-1.0.2.apk\",\"updater.png\"],\"skipped\":[],\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"rom-linux.zip\":3,\"rom-macos.zip\":8,\"rom-windows.zip\":4,\"rom.zip\":16,\"rondo-1.0.2.apk\":8,\"updater.png\":8},\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-08T00:59:21Z\",\"retired\":{}},\"updater\":{\"linux\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Linux-Portable.zip\",\"size\":387920108,\"tag\":\"2.5.1\"},\"macos\":{\"name\":\"Innioasis.Updater.for.Mac.dmg\",\"size\":119863064,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"},\"windows\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Windows-Portable.zip\",\"size\":205854850,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"}},\"v\":11} -->\n",
