  {
    "id": 432908504,
    "tag_name": "v1.0.1",
    "name": "Portable Flashing Package: Rondo 1.0.1",
    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=jarvissax%2Frondo&amp;tag=v1.0.1#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Y1 \u00b7 Type A**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/releases/download/v1.0.1/rom-windows.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/releases/download/v1.0.1/rom-linux.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/releases/download/v1.0.1/rom-macos.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\nA small update to Rondo for the **Innioasis Y1, Type A**. If your Y1 already runs Rondo, it installs over the one you have in about a minute, and everything stays: settings, Wi-Fi, server connection, playlists and music.\n\n## What's new\n\n- **Click sound stays off.** Turning off **Settings \u203a Click sound** (or the switch in the dashboard) now lasts through a restart. Before, the Y1's own sound profile turned the click back on every time it started.\n- **Every release now comes with its firmware.** The `rom.zip` that Innioasis Updater CE installs is built automatically for each release, so a new install always gets the newest Rondo.\n- **Rondo knows which updates it can install.** The firmware now carries a version of its own. If a future release changes the firmware itself, not only Rondo, Settings \u203a Software update, the dashboard and the update page say so and point you to Innioasis Updater CE, instead of offering an install that couldn't work.\n- **One place for news of a release.** The Y1 (through your server), the dashboard and the update page all learn about a new Rondo from the update page, once its firmware is ready, so they always agree with each other and with Innioasis Updater CE.\n- **New README and guides**, with screenshots.\n\nThe full list is in [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/jarvissax/rondo/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md).\n\n## Updating from 1.0.0\n\nPick whichever is handiest; none of them reinstalls the firmware:\n\n- **On the Y1:** Settings \u203a Software update, then **Install now** (needs your Rondo server).\n- **In the dashboard:** Settings \u203a Dashboard on the Y1, open it on your phone, press **Install**.\n- **Over USB:** open [the update page](https://jarvissax.github.io/rondo/) in Chrome or Edge and plug the Y1 in.\n\nIf you run a Rondo server, update it too ([how](https://github.com/jarvissax/rondo/blob/main/docs/server.md#keeping-it-running)); it's 1.0.1 as well.\n\n## Installing for the first time\n\nChoose **Rondo** in [Innioasis Updater CE](https://innioasis.app) (Y1, then Type A), or download `rom.zip` below and use the Updater's **Settings \u203a Install from a file\u2026**. Installing replaces everything on the Y1 itself; **the microSD card isn't touched**. The [install guide](https://github.com/jarvissax/rondo/blob/main/docs/install.md) has the details.\n\nOnly for the **Y1 Type A** (players that shipped with software 2.0.0 or later), not the Type B or the Y2.\n\n## Files\n\n- `rom.zip`: the firmware, for Innioasis Updater CE (Y1 Type A). Built from `rondo-1.0.1.apk` by this repository's release workflow, a few minutes after publishing.\n- `rondo-1.0.1.apk`: the update, for a Y1 that already runs the Rondo firmware.\n- `updater.png`: the picture Innioasis Updater CE shows for this release.\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"a8b0c2984b19e291ded5eafac93c280e178062340529a99bb1fab96de8bbe2c7\",\"size\":844850257,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"aa2dbad315418d3b9b18d8e122adb2a930bfe53591bb2235c1c9ebda428d64d4\",\"size\":578893271,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"8b9ac4d7992f49482fda2399eb9c4eee0282529b90520c8a5236bdb304c8cca3\",\"size\":663361275,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-08T00:57:13Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"0af34521147b74be227b089c9e381192cc942e763e5ae3ba19ead1bb97697f57\",\"original_assets\":[\"rom.zip\",\"rondo-1.0.1.apk\",\"updater.png\"],\"skipped\":[],\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"rom-linux.zip\":0,\"rom-macos.zip\":4,\"rom-windows.zip\":2,\"rom.zip\":8,\"rondo-1.0.1.apk\":4,\"updater.png\":0},\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-08T00:57:13Z\",\"retired\":{}},\"updater\":{\"linux\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Linux-Portable.zip\",\"size\":387920108,\"tag\":\"2.5.1\"},\"macos\":{\"name\":\"Innioasis.Updater.for.Mac.dmg\",\"size\":119863064,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"},\"windows\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Windows-Portable.zip\",\"size\":205854850,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"}},\"v\":11} -->\n",
