  {
    "id": 432900931,
    "tag_name": "v1.0.0",
    "name": "Portable Flashing Package: Rondo 1.0.0",
    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=jarvissax%2Frondo&amp;tag=v1.0.0#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Y1 \u00b7 Type A**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/releases/download/v1.0.0/rom-windows.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/releases/download/v1.0.0/rom-linux.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/releases/download/v1.0.0/rom-macos.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/rondo-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\nRondo is now a firmware for the Innioasis Y1: the Y1 starts straight into Rondo's click-wheel menus, with nothing else on it.\n\n**For the Y1, Type A only** (players that shipped with software 2.0.0 or later). Not for the Type B or the Y2.\n\n## Install\n\nChoose **Rondo** in [Innioasis Updater CE](https://innioasis.app) (Y1, Type A). Or download `rom.zip` below and use the Updater's **Settings \u203a Install from a file\u2026**.\n\nInstalling replaces everything on the Y1 itself: the original player, Rockbox, settings. **The microSD card isn't touched**, so your music stays. When the Updater is done, press the Y1's Power button; the first start takes a couple of minutes. The [install guide](https://github.com/jarvissax/rondo/blob/main/docs/install.md) has the details and the first steps after it.\n\nFor YouTube Music and YouTube, [set up a Rondo server](https://github.com/jarvissax/rondo/blob/main/docs/server.md) with Docker, at home or on a VPS.\n\n## Updates\n\nLater versions install over this one in a minute, without flashing again, keeping your settings, Wi-Fi, playlists and music: **Settings \u203a Software update** on the Y1, **Install** in the dashboard, or [the update page](https://jarvissax.github.io/rondo/) over USB.\n\n## What's in it\n\n- iPod-style menus for the click wheel, with optional vibration and a click on every step\n- Your music and videos from the microSD card, with covers, lyrics, search and playlists\n- The card as a USB drive when the Y1 is plugged into a computer\n- YouTube Music and YouTube, streamed live through your own server, including Shorts, with or without a YouTube account\n- FM radio with station names, scanning and saved stations\n- Bluetooth headphones and speakers, and Wi-Fi, set up from the wheel\n- A dashboard in your phone's browser for music, playlists, settings, the theme, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the radio and updates\n- Shut down and restart from Settings, or by holding the Power button\n\n## Good to know\n\n- Only the Y1 Type A is supported; the Type B and Y2 haven't been tested.\n- Rockbox, the original player and Android's own Settings aren't part of Rondo. Innioasis Updater CE puts any of them back.\n- YouTube Music and YouTube need your own Rondo server; the card, the radio and Bluetooth don't.\n\n## Files\n\n| File | What it is | SHA-256 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `rom.zip` | The firmware, for Innioasis Updater CE (Y1 Type A) | `97855240680f2f71f0e33147bd6f7567f4bf17e2efb082d495dc55b2877a0b6c` |\n| `rondo-1.0.0.apk` | Rondo by itself: updates a Y1 that runs the Rondo firmware | `911edd65b8f375e452c05e2004c1c817215a65f9a56d023c5acfb9a7d0857edd` |\n| `updater.png` | The picture Innioasis Updater CE shows for this release | `40b9f5679e2f84b4dd7c6fda968abf702df3ccb6b743fcb88e142eeb8b52047e` |\n\nThe firmware is built with [`firmware/build.sh`](https://github.com/jarvissax/rondo/blob/main/firmware/build.sh) from the y1-community's [Android 4.2 base ROM](https://github.com/y1-community/y1-ata-rom) (0.1, Type A). Its scatter file, preloader and flashing files are the base ROM's, unchanged.\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"30bc2cd041f3d180ef4581a1946868678a6e2424f75a432c642198d87705245b\",\"size\":844850473,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"28a302a4d35408279b9bd8388ef6d936f76592f5cb0291d6f6f0338f145f9fe1\",\"size\":578893486,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"86b63a7c7ea483aa3e0ea18e6cf2d717c8587db8f99b00ff267a50a2f7f97234\",\"size\":663361491,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-08T00:55:08Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"35e4da82e666d5fd8f4d4aafdb9e268b3d92b582443b15528fae5650b8bf46af\",\"original_assets\":[\"rom.zip\",\"rondo-1.0.0.apk\",\"updater.png\"],\"skipped\":[],\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"rom-linux.zip\":2,\"rom-macos.zip\":5,\"rom-windows.zip\":1,\"rom.zip\":4,\"rondo-1.0.0.apk\":8,\"updater.png\":0},\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-08T00:55:08Z\",\"retired\":{}},\"updater\":{\"linux\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Linux-Portable.zip\",\"size\":387920108,\"tag\":\"2.5.1\"},\"macos\":{\"name\":\"Innioasis.Updater.for.Mac.dmg\",\"size\":119863064,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"},\"windows\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Windows-Portable.zip\",\"size\":205854850,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"}},\"v\":11} -->\n",
